# CinderDeep 3D workspace instructions for Goose

This folder is the standalone, fresh-code workspace for CinderDeep 3D. Start by reading AGENTS.md, GAMEPLAY_SPEC.md, and LOCAL_AI_GUIDE.md.

Build the game from the brief in this folder. Do not look for, copy, or import old Cinderdeep HTML, scripts, or artwork. Do not edit files outside projects/cinderdeep-3d or initialize the repository's unrelated upstream submodules.

The world must be real 3D rendered with Three.js. GSAP is required for meaningful in-game/UI animation. Keep the project modular and data-driven. Implement a polished playable vertical slice first, then continue through the guide's milestones without stopping at a plan.

Honor the current CDC-V8 life rules: permanent death, ten survived descents to unlock the Realm for that life, and one account-wide Shared Talent Atlas that persists across lives. Never add respawn or resurrection.

Keep the app runnable. Install from package.json, build after milestones, fix errors before expanding, and update package-lock.json after dependency installation. Do not commit node_modules or dist.
